# Quote Follow-Up AI Automation
  Automatically follow up on clients regarding outstanding quotes

## What this automation does
  Video Demo: 
  
  This automation qualifies the customer by:
  - Detect new customer quotes added to system
  - Process quote information
  - AI Agent composes email reminders for clients using quote info
  - Emails get sent out to team for important notifications
  - Gives clients time to consider their decision

## Who this is for
  - Trade Businesses
  - Real estate agents
  - service based businesses that are overloaded with clients

## Key features
  - CRM Integration
  - AI powered qualification agent
  - works 24/7 
  - Instant emails get sent to team
  - Automatic follow up process to clients
  - Team member responsible to update system if client responds to quote

## How it works
  1) Quote is sent to client and added to system by team member (manual input)
  2) After 2 days with no response from client, AI Agent composes follow up email using quote info
  3) Client recieves email with option to "Decline" (if rejecting quote) or "Accept" (if still deciding)
  4) If "Decline" then team recieves automatic email notifyting that quote was rejected
  5) If "Accept" then we wait 3 more days
  6) If no response after 3 days, then AI Agent composes final email reminder
  7) Client recieves final follow up with options to "Accept" (if wish to proceed) or "Decline" (if with to reject)
  8) Once client clicks an option, team recieves automatic email notfication, with suggestions to update system

## Tech Stack
  - n8n (workflow automation)
  - OpenAI chat model (gpt-5-mini)
  - Gmail (communication channel)
  - Google sheets (lead storage)
